# Streaming assistant: the reply grows in place while the reader follows the bottom, then
# drags away (following is released) and comes back; history is prepended at the top.
route Assistant
latency 250,700
wait 3
mark send-suggestion
press 105 337
wait 8
mark drag-away-mid-stream
pan 200 300 0 420 700
wait 6
mark drag-back-mid-stream
repeat 3 pan 200 700 0 -500 200
wait 10
mark send-next
press 333 80
wait 12
mark drag-away-again
pan 200 300 0 450 600
wait 8
mark load-earlier
press 296 80
wait 4
mark statusbar-top
statusbar
wait 4
